  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vehicle Emissions Standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGGI will support the development of a vehicle and fuel standards for Vanuatu to improve the efficiency of the engines and their emissions. GGGI will engage a technical expert to support his work.The activities are split up into three main parts:-          Data collection and assessment of the current fuel and vehicle standards-          Preparation of a proposal document to establish feasible and adequate standards for the goal to reduce GHG emissions-          Stakeholder participation in initial interviews, a workshop, and a feedback sessionThe principal deliverables will be both, a recommendation on i) fuel standards and ii) vehicle emission standards.Apart from supporting a reduction in GHG emissions, the reduction of pollutants can lead to better air quality and a reduction to the related burden of disease by inhabitants and a reduced burden on the public health system.</narrative>
  </description>
